{"seq":3,"slug":"memory-battery-profiling","title":"内存与电量分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/performance-monitoring/memory-battery-profiling","wordCount":1519,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"内存与电量分析\">内存与电量分析</h1><p>内存泄漏和异常耗电是移动端最阴险的性能问题——它们不会立即崩溃或报错，而是像慢性病一样在用户设备上逐步恶化。用户感知到的是&quot;手机越来越烫&quot;、&quot;电量掉得快&quot;、&quot;用一会儿就被系统杀掉&quot;。这些问题在开发环境几乎不可见，只有通过线上监控数据才能发现和定位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>内存与电量问题的共同特征是<strong>渐进式恶化</strong>——不会立即崩溃或报错，而是随使用时间累积。内存泄漏表现为单调递增的内存曲线，异常耗电表现为后台 CPU/网络的持续活动。两者的监控策略都依赖时序数据的趋势检测，而非单点阈值告警。OOM 是内存问题的终态，其特殊性在于系统静默终止进程，传统崩溃 SDK 无法捕获。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内存度量体系\">内存度量体系</h2><p>移动应用的内存管理面临系统级约束——操作系统对每个应用分配的内存有硬上限（Memory Budget），超过后系统直接终止进程（OOM Kill），不会抛出任何异常：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>内存管理方式</th>\n<th>OOM 终止信号</th>\n<th>典型预算（旗舰设备）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>iOS</td>\n<td>Jetsam（系统级内存管理）</td>\n<td>无信号，静默 kill</td>\n<td>1.5-2.5 GB（取决于设备总 RAM）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Android</td>\n<td>Low Memory Killer (LMK)</td>\n<td>无信号（前台）/ OOM 异常（Java 堆）</td>\n<td>256-512 MB（Java 堆限制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Android 11+</td>\n<td><code>ApplicationExitInfo</code></td>\n<td>事后可查 REASON_LOW_MEMORY</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键内存指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Memory Pressure</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>App Memory Usage</mtext><mtext>Device Available Memory</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Memory Pressure} = \\frac{\\text{App Memory Usage}}{\\text{Device Available Memory}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Memory Pressure</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Device Available Memory</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">App Memory Usage</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>OOM 风险</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>Low</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if Usage</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>Budget</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>Medium</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mn>0.6</mn><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mtext>Usage</mtext><mtext>Budget</mtext></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>High</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if Usage</mtext><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.8</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>Budget</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{OOM 风险} = \\begin{cases} \\text{Low} &amp; \\text{if Usage} &lt; 0.6 \\times \\text{Budget} \\\\ \\text{Medium} &amp; \\text{if } 0.6 \\leq \\frac{\\text{Usage}}{\\text{Budget}} &lt; 0.8 \\\\ \\text{High} &amp; \\text{if Usage} \\geq 0.8 \\times \\text{Budget} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OOM </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">风险</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.3691em;vertical-align:-1.9346em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.4346em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.4346em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Low</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9946em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Medium</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.5054em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">High</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.9346em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.4346em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.4346em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if Usage</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Budget</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9946em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9244em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Budget</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Usage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.5054em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if Usage</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Budget</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.9346em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"oom-检测与归因\">OOM 检测与归因</h2><p>OOM（Out of Memory）崩溃是传统崩溃 SDK 的盲区——系统杀进程时不发送信号，Signal Handler 无法捕获。检测方案：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[应用正常运行] --&gt; B[系统内存压力升高]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Jetsam/LMK 终止进程]&#10;    C --&gt; D[下次启动]&#10;    D --&gt; E{排除法判断}&#10;    E --&gt;|上次非正常退出&lt;br/&gt;+ 无 crash log&lt;br/&gt;+ 非用户手动 kill| F[判定为 OOM]&#10;    E --&gt;|有 crash log| G[判定为 crash]&#10;    E --&gt;|用户手动滑杀| H[正常退出]&#10;    F --&gt; I[上报 OOM 事件]&#10;    I --&gt; J[关联上次会话&lt;br/&gt;最后内存快照]\">flowchart TD\n    A[应用正常运行] --&gt; B[系统内存压力升高]\n    B --&gt; C[Jetsam/LMK 终止进程]\n    C --&gt; D[下次启动]\n    D --&gt; E{排除法判断}\n    E --&gt;|上次非正常退出&lt;br/&gt;+ 无 crash log&lt;br/&gt;+ 非用户手动 kill| F[判定为 OOM]\n    E --&gt;|有 crash log| G[判定为 crash]\n    E --&gt;|用户手动滑杀| H[正常退出]\n    F --&gt; I[上报 OOM 事件]\n    I --&gt; J[关联上次会话&lt;br/&gt;最后内存快照]</pre><p><strong>iOS OOM 检测</strong>：Sentry 和 Crashlytics 使用&quot;排除法&quot;——如果上次退出不是正常退出（<code>applicationWillTerminate</code> 未调用）、不是崩溃（无 crash log）、不是升级/调试/后台清理，则判定为 OOM。MetricKit 的 <code>MXCrashDiagnostic</code> 在 iOS 14+ 可直接获取 jetsam 事件。</p>\n<p><strong>Android OOM 检测</strong>：<code>ApplicationExitInfo</code>（Android 11+）明确提供 <code>REASON_LOW_MEMORY</code> 作为退出原因：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val exitReasons = activityManager.getHistoricalProcessExitReasons(&#10;    packageName, 0, 10&#10;)&#10;for (reason in exitReasons) {&#10;    if (reason.reason == ApplicationExitInfo.REASON_LOW_MEMORY) {&#10;        reportOomEvent(reason.timestamp, reason.pss, reason.rss)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val exitReasons = activityManager.getHistoricalProcessExitReasons(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    packageName, 0, 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>for (reason in exitReasons) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (reason.reason == ApplicationExitInfo.REASON_LOW_MEMORY) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        reportOomEvent(reason.timestamp, reason.pss, reason.rss)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"内存泄漏的线上监控\">内存泄漏的线上监控</h2><p>内存泄漏的特征是随使用时间增长内存单调递增。线上监控策略：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>定时快照</strong>：每 30 秒记录当前内存使用量（RSS/PSS），形成时序数据</li>\n<li><strong>会话级峰值</strong>：记录每次会话的内存峰值（Peak Memory），用于版本间对比</li>\n<li><strong>增长率检测</strong>：计算连续 N 个快照的内存增长斜率，超过阈值报警</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Growth Rate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>Memory</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Growth Rate} = \\frac{\\Delta \\text{Memory}}{\\Delta t} = \\frac{M_{t_n} - M_{t_1}}{t_n - t_1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Growth Rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Memory</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Growth Rate</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> MB/min</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Growth Rate} &gt; 1 \\text{ MB/min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Growth Rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> MB/min</span></span></span></span></span></span> 持续 5 分钟以上，极可能存在泄漏。</p>\n<p>Firebase Performance 的 Memory Gauge 自动采集前台应用的堆内存使用情况。Sentry 在每个 transaction span 上附带内存水位标记。但精确的泄漏归因需要更重量级的工具（如 Instruments/Android Profiler），线上监控的职责是<strong>发现问题并提供线索</strong>，而非完成全部诊断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"电量消耗度量\">电量消耗度量</h2><p>电池是移动设备最稀缺的资源。异常耗电的应用会被系统标记、被用户卸载。电量消耗的度量分为直接测量和间接推断：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>度量方式</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MetricKit <code>MXCPUMetric</code></td>\n<td>iOS 系统聚合</td>\n<td>中（24h 统计）</td>\n<td>版本间趋势对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Battery Historian</td>\n<td>Android bugreport 分析</td>\n<td>高（分钟级）</td>\n<td>开发调试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU 时间累计</td>\n<td>自采集</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>线上监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后台活动频率</td>\n<td>系统 API</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>后台唤醒检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络传输量</td>\n<td>URLSession/OkHttp</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>间接推断电量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>影响电池的主要因素可以用一个简化模型表达：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>cpu</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>network</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>wakeup</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>gps</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{total}} \\approx \\alpha \\cdot T_{\\text{cpu}} + \\beta \\cdot D_{\\text{network}} + \\gamma \\cdot N_{\\text{wakeup}} + \\delta \\cdot T_{\\text{gps}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cpu</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">network</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wakeup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gps</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>cpu</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{cpu}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cpu</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为 CPU 活跃时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>network</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{network}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">network</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为网络数据传输量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>wakeup</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{wakeup}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wakeup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为后台唤醒次数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>gps</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{gps}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gps</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为 GPS 使用时长。各系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha, \\beta, \\gamma, \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 因设备硬件而异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ios-电量诊断\">iOS 电量诊断</h2><p>Apple MetricKit 提供 <code>MXCPUMetric</code>（CPU 时间）和 <code>MXNetworkTransferMetric</code>（网络流量）作为电量的间接度量。iOS 16+ 的 <code>MXAppExitMetric</code> 还报告因过度 CPU 使用被系统终止（watchdog kill）的事件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func processMetrics(_ payload: MXMetricPayload) {&#10;    if let cpu = payload.cpuMetrics {&#10;        let totalCPU = cpu.cumulativeCPUTime  // 累计 CPU 时间&#10;        let instructionsRetired = cpu.cumulativeCPUInstructions&#10;        reportCPUUsage(totalCPU, instructionsRetired)&#10;    }&#10;    if let network = payload.networkTransferMetrics {&#10;        let cellular = network.cumulativeCellularUpload.converted(to: .megabytes)&#10;        let wifi = network.cumulativeWifiUpload.converted(to: .megabytes)&#10;        reportNetworkUsage(cellular: cellular, wifi: wifi)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processMetrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payload: MXMetricPayload) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cpu </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payload.cpuMetrics {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalCPU </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cpu.cumulativeCPUTime  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 累计 CPU 时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instructionsRetired </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cpu.cumulativeCPUInstructions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        reportCPUUsage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(totalCPU, instructionsRetired)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> network </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payload.networkTransferMetrics {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cellular </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> network.cumulativeCellularUpload.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">converted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .megabytes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wifi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> network.cumulativeWifiUpload.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">converted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .megabytes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        reportNetworkUsage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cellular</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: cellular, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">wifi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: wifi)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"android-电量监控\">Android 电量监控</h2><p>Android 的 Battery Historian 提供极其详细的电量消耗归因，但仅适用于开发调试。线上监控通常采集以下代理指标：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[电量监控数据源] --&gt; B[CPU 使用率&lt;br/&gt;每分钟采样]&#10;    A --&gt; C[WakeLock 持有时长]&#10;    A --&gt; D[后台 JobScheduler&lt;br/&gt;执行频率]&#10;    A --&gt; E[GPS 请求频率&lt;br/&gt;和精度]&#10;    A --&gt; F[网络请求频率&lt;br/&gt;和数据量]&#10;    B --&gt; G[聚合上报]&#10;    C --&gt; G&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[版本间对比&lt;br/&gt;异常检测]\">flowchart TD\n    A[电量监控数据源] --&gt; B[CPU 使用率&lt;br/&gt;每分钟采样]\n    A --&gt; C[WakeLock 持有时长]\n    A --&gt; D[后台 JobScheduler&lt;br/&gt;执行频率]\n    A --&gt; E[GPS 请求频率&lt;br/&gt;和精度]\n    A --&gt; F[网络请求频率&lt;br/&gt;和数据量]\n    B --&gt; G[聚合上报]\n    C --&gt; G\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[版本间对比&lt;br/&gt;异常检测]</pre><p><strong>WakeLock 泄漏</strong>是 Android 上最常见的电量问题——应用获取了 WakeLock 但未释放，导致设备无法进入低功耗状态。监控方式是记录每个 WakeLock 的获取与释放时间，超过阈值（如 60 秒）未释放的标记为疑似泄漏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内存与电量数据的运营价值\">内存与电量数据的运营价值</h2><p>内存和电量数据不仅是技术指标，更是产品健康度的信号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>内存峰值随版本持续增长 → 技术债务积累的量化证据</li>\n<li>某功能路径的内存增长率显著高于平均 → 定位泄漏到具体功能模块</li>\n<li>后台 CPU 时间突增 → 新增的后台任务可能存在死循环或过度同步</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些数据应纳入<a href=\"../platform-operations/alerting-incident-response\">告警与应急响应</a>的监控看板，与<a href=\"../crash-stability/crash-reporting-systems\">崩溃上报</a>中的 OOM 事件交叉验证——OOM 频发的版本必然伴随内存曲线的异常上升趋势。同时，<a href=\"network-api-monitoring\">网络监控</a>中的数据传输量是电量消耗模型的重要输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>内存与电量是移动端最容易被忽视的性能维度——开发环境难以复现，只有线上监控能发现。OOM 的排除法检测和 ApplicationExitInfo API 填补了传统崩溃 SDK 的盲区。电量消耗通过 CPU 时间、网络传输量、后台唤醒次数等代理指标间接度量。WakeLock 泄漏是 Android 异常耗电的头号根因。版本间的内存峰值和 CPU 时间趋势对比是技术债务积累的量化证据。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内存与电量分析","id":"内存与电量分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"内存度量体系","id":"内存度量体系"},{"level":2,"text":"OOM 检测与归因","id":"oom-检测与归因"},{"level":2,"text":"内存泄漏的线上监控","id":"内存泄漏的线上监控"},{"level":2,"text":"电量消耗度量","id":"电量消耗度量"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS 电量诊断","id":"ios-电量诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"Android 电量监控","id":"android-电量监控"},{"level":2,"text":"内存与电量数据的运营价值","id":"内存与电量数据的运营价值"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"网络与 API 监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/performance-monitoring/network-api-monitoring"},"next":{"title":"分析 SDK 集成实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/platform-operations/analytics-sdk-integration"}}